            </note>
            <note corresp="#d600-f2" n="2" xml:id="d600-f2-content">
                <p>Telegram 3259 from Paris, Mar. 8, not printed, contained the translation of a
                    communiqué issued by the Vietnamese High Commissariat on Mar. 5 regarding
                    demands made to Bao Dai by the “National
                    Union Movement for Peace” looking toward the creation of a national assembly
                    prior to the Geneva Conference. (751G.00/3–854)</p>
            </note>
